---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms & Conditions | Alessio Miccichè">
  <Navbar />
  
  <main class="terms-container">
    <header class="terms-header">
      <span class="label" data-i18n="terms.label">LEGAL FRAMEWORK</span>
      <h1 data-i18n="terms.title">Terms & Conditions</h1>
      <p class="last-updated" data-i18n="terms.lastUpdated">Last updated: February 20, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="terms-content">
      <section>
        <h2 data-i18n="terms.sections.0.heading">1. Website Use</h2>
        <p data-i18n-html="terms.sections.0.body">By accessing this portfolio, you agree to use it for lawful purposes. Unauthorized scraping, malware distribution, or attempting to breach the security of this site is strictly prohibited.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 data-i18n="terms.sections.1.heading">2. Service Provision (B2B)</h2>
        <p data-i18n-html="terms.sections.1.body">The following terms apply to all professional engineering services, consultancy, and software delivery provided by Alessio Miccichè:</p>
        <ul>
          <li data-i18n-html="terms.sections.1.list.0"><strong>Best Efforts:</strong> Services are performed to the best of my professional ability (inspanningsverbintenis). No specific result is guaranteed unless explicitly stated in writing.</li>
          <li data-i18n-html="terms.sections.1.list.1"><strong>Browser Support:</strong> Support is guaranteed for the last two major versions of Chrome, Safari, Firefox, and Edge. Legacy browsers are not supported.</li>
          <li data-i18n-html="terms.sections.1.list.2"><strong>Data Provision:</strong> The client is responsible for timely delivery of necessary assets (API keys, credentials, designs). Delays caused by the client are at the client's risk.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 data-i18n="terms.sections.2.heading">3. Payments & Late Fees</h2>
        <p data-i18n-html="terms.sections.2.body">Invoices must be paid within <strong>30 days</strong>. Failure to pay on time results in an automatic default. In such cases, a late interest rate of 10% per year and a fixed compensation fee of 10% (min. €75) will be charged.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 data-i18n="terms.sections.3.heading">4. Intellectual Property & Licensing</h2>
        <p data-i18n-html="terms.sections.3.body">All source code, designs, and documentation remain my exclusive intellectual property. The client receives a non-exclusive, non-transferable license to use the software only <strong>after full payment</strong> has been received.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 data-i18n="terms.sections.4.heading">5. Liability & Third Parties</h2>
        <p data-i18n-html="terms.sections.4.body">My liability is limited to the invoice value of the project. I am not liable for indirect damages, data loss, or failures caused by third-party services (e.g., AWS, Stripe, hosting providers). Updates required due to third-party "breaking changes" are considered additional work (meerwerk).</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 data-i18n="terms.sections.5.heading">6. Jurisdiction</h2>
        <p data-i18n-html="terms.sections.5.body">These terms are governed by <strong>Belgian Law</strong>. Any disputes shall be settled exclusively by the courts of the judicial district of <strong>Limburg, Hasselt division</strong>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .terms-container { max-width: 850px; margin: 15vh auto 10vh; padding: 0 5%; color: #fff; }
  .terms-header { margin-bottom: 4rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding-bottom: 2rem; }
  .label { color: #0088cc; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px; }
  h1 { font-size: 3rem; margin: 0.5rem 0; }
  .terms-content section { margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  h2 { color: #0088cc; font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
  p, li { line-height: 1.8; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  ul { padding-left: 1.5rem; }
  strong { color: #fff; }
</style>